The array is supposed to decrease in size by one whenever we remove an element using the method RemoveAt(). So the expression `OLD(Count) - 1` is checking how many elements were in the ArrayList before `RemoveAt(index)` was called. And then it is comparing that with the returned value `RET` which represents the expected count after the `RemoveAt(index)` has been called.

